        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mëë cia jɔw liŋ däär muɔ̱th kä pɛt päm kɛ mac, cu bööth thuk duëlikun kɛnɛ di̱tkun kɛn diaal ben kutdä, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä /cuarɛ wee, ‘Nɛnɛ, ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothda kɔ nyuɔ̱th gɔɔydɛ kɛnɛ liakdɛ, kä cakɔ jɔwdɛ liŋ däär maac. Cakɔ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ruac Kuoth kɛ raan kä ŋotdɛ kɛ tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋu ba̱kɔ li̱w ɔ, ɛn täämɛ? Ɛn mac ɛ di̱i̱t ɛmɛ bɛ kɔ näk. Ba̱kɔ li̱w mi wa̱kɔ ŋot kɛ mi liɛŋkɔ jɔw Kuɔth Nhial Kuothda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋa kä nɛy diaal, mi ci jɔw Kuɔth in tëk kɔn liŋ däär maac, ce̱t mi te kɔnɛ kä ŋotdɛ kɛ tëk? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wër thiekä, kä liŋ tin diaal tin bi Kuoth Nhial Kuothdan kɛ lat, kä ber lätni nɛy tin diaal tin ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdan kɛ la̱t ji̱, ba̱kɔ kɛ liŋ kä ba̱kɔ kɛ la̱t.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ci Kuoth Nhial yɛ liŋ guäth ëë ruacɛ thi̱n kɛ ɣä. Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ɣä jiök i̱, ‘Ɣän cä ruac nɛɛni ti̱ti̱ liŋ, tin ca la̱t ji̱, kɛn tin lat kɛn kɛ kɛ cuŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi deekɛ ca̱r inɔ ni ciaŋ, luɔ̱thkɛ ɣä kä tiit kɛn luëëkä, derɛ gɔaa kɛ kɛ amäni karkiɛn amäni cäŋ kɛl! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wër jiök nikɛ i̱ luɔcɛ dho̱rikun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱n cuŋni wa̱nɛ mi kutdä, mäni mi cä ji̱ la̱t luëëk kɛnɛ ŋuɔ̱t tin bi wä ŋi̱i̱c nikɛ. Kɛ ɣöö bikɛn kɛ wä la̱t muun in cä ka̱m kɛ in ba wä ciɛŋ.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
